# Adrenaline Jockey: "a player" includes its controller. Bot1 casts an Ornithopter on its own turn 1 after the Jockey is in play: its
# turn, no damage (Bot1 stays at 20). On Bot2's turn 2 Bot1 casts a Lightning Bolt at Bot2: not Bot1's turn, so the Jockey deals 4
# to Bot1 (16) off its own spell, and the Bolt still takes Bot2 to 17. Nothing is dealt to the other player.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Adrenaline Jockey
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Adrenaline Jockey.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 20
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 16
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 16
Bot2.Life = 17
